</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">31 (8.9)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5 (0.3)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">31 (22, 43)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Haemoglobin 12&#x02013;12.9&#x02009;g&#x02009;dl<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">17 (4.9)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">20 (1.2)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4.3 (2.7, 6.8)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Haemoglobin 10&#x02013;11.9&#x02009;g&#x02009;dl<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">38 (10.9)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">49 (2.8)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3.9 (2.8, 5.2)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Haemoglobin &#x0003c;10&#x02009;g&#x02009;dl<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">40 (11.5)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">21 (1.2)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">9.5 (7.1, 13)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Blood sugar &#x0003e;10&#x02009;mmol&#x02009;l<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">25 (7.1)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">39 (2.2)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3.2 (2.2, 4.7)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Miscellaneous</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;History of diabetes</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">37 (10.6)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">119 (6.8)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.6 (1.2, 2.1)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote1"><label>a</label><p>From the 79 (23&#x00025;) cases and 47 (3&#x00025;) controls who had been tested.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Multivariable conditional logistic regression analysis of prediagnostic features of colorectal cancer</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Variable</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>Odds ratio</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>95&#x00025; CI</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold><italic>P</italic>-value</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Symptoms</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Rectal bleeding</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">15</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">9.0, 24</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Loss of weight</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.7</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.7, 4.6</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Number of episodes of abdominal pain<sup>a</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.2<sup>b</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.7, 2.8</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Constipation</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.0</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.2, 3.3</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.006</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Number of episodes of diarrhoea</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.6<sup>b</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.3, 2.0</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Signs</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Rectal disease on rectal examination</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">13</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4.7, 37</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Tenderness on palpation of abdomen<sup>a</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3.6</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.7, 7.8</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.001</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Investigations</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Positive faecal occult blood<sup>a</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">81</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">20, 330</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Low haemoglobin, category</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02003;No low haemoglobin</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02003;Haemoglobin 12.0&#x02013;12.9&#x02009;g&#x02009;dl<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.5</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.95, 6.8</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02003;Haemoglobin 10.0&#x02013;11.9&#x02009;g&#x02009;dl<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4.3</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.1, 9.0</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02003;Haemoglobin &#x0003c;10&#x02009;g&#x02009;dl<sup>&#x02212;1</sup><sup>a</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">13</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">6.2, 28</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02003;Blood sugar &#x0003e;10&#x02009;mmol&#x02009;l<sup>&#x02212;1</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.0</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.3, 3.1</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.001</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Interaction terms</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Abdominal pain with tenderness</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.56</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.38, 0.82</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.003</td></tr><tr><t